<title>NETHERLANDS: TECHNICAL GLITCH HITS LATE DUTCH SHARE TRADING.</title>
<headline>TECHNICAL GLITCH HITS LATE DUTCH SHARE TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Amsterdam stock exchange said on Tuesday technical problems had disrupted trading during the final 25 minutes of business from 1505 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said that because of this it had decided to cancel all prices and related transactions from that time.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
